{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic Warzones</strong> is a sci-fi battle arena, focused on player versus player gameplay. You will experience exhilarating action combat with limited action sets and deep character customization that is typically only found in MMOs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-paced Action Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action Combat, No Tab Targeting, Wildstar-Inspired Telegraphs, Limited Ability Set</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arena Style Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 v 1 or 5 v 5 <br>Capture The Flag <br>Conquest <br>Deathmatch</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Robust Character Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize nearly everything about your character and truly express yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157180/extras/24ddca260be92d582ed27f4cf81120bf.poster.avif?t=1764088709\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157180/extras/24ddca260be92d582ed27f4cf81120bf.webm?t=1764088709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157180/extras/24ddca260be92d582ed27f4cf81120bf.mp4?t=1764088709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classless Skill Trees</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose abilities from 6 different Skill Trees to make your own unique Ability Sets that work with your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Medic:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157180/extras/7ea8fe71b6a570abe6dfde0df73f4f89.poster.avif?t=1764088709\" wi